WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:08.350
In January, students from Gran Canaria, Iceland and Denmark meet on one island, to build something that matters.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.360
This year, they build with AI. Any tool, any part of the project.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.769
But AI makes mistakes.

00:00:18.769 --> 00:00:23.050
So every student checks its work, and owns every line they ship.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.671
At the end of each day, the students write a few notes.

00:00:27.671 --> 00:00:29.870
And the AI writes its own account.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.701
On the twenty-first, teachers visit every group, in mixed pairs.

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:39.780
One asks, one marks, and each student explains their own code.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.102
On the twenty-second, a break:

00:00:43.102 --> 00:00:46.410
a bus trip around the island, and a day at the beach.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.050
Then back to work, and the notes keep growing.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:58.560
At the end, the AI turns all the notes into the team's report, including what it got wrong.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:05.698
We grade how well you understand your work, not how much AI you used. Use AI.

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:08.050
Own every line. Show your work.
